{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If you see an object, approach it. Pick it up if close enough. Process it. Move to destination. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinRange    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
